know where your glasses are and you

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:52.630
could have them back under one condition
and I said what's that they said if you

00:03:52.630 --> 00:03:56.829
promise to come back it teaches more
about filmmaking and I said well that's

00:03:56.829 --> 00:03:59.859
